  "historyNote": "(See Revision Note #1 at Chapter Heading He-W 600) #5171, eff 6-26-91; ss by #5370, eff 4-13-92; amd by #6672, eff 1-26-98; ss by #6754, eff 5-20-98; ss by #8596, eff 3-30-06; ss by #10563, eff 3-30-14; ss by #10860, eff 6-30-15; amd by #12697, eff 12-31-18; ss by #14299, eff 7-1-25, EXPIRES: 7-1-35",
